# Minimal agent profile (PROFILE=minimal): core CLI toolchain only.
# Kept: gh/jq/ripgrep/gitleaks (+ shellcheck — this repo mandates it for its
# own scripts). rust comes from step 35 (rustup), node from mise post-provision
# (`mise use -g node@lts`; go likewise — runtimes are mise's, not brew's), claude
# from step 37. Dropped vs the full Brewfile: bat/eza/zoxide/fzf/btop and friends
# (.zshrc guards those aliases with `command -v`), nvim, and the k8s/docker TUIs.
brew "gh"
brew "glab"
brew "gitleaks"
brew "jq"
brew "mise"
brew "ripgrep"
brew "shellcheck"
